        "content": "I can't confirm that the purchase order for REQ-1 went through. I submitted it, but the system reported the outcome as unknown, so I reported REQ-1 as \"unknown\".\n\n- **Order submitted:** 100 units of W-100 from S-1 at 5.40 USD per unit, charged to CC-OPS. That is 540.00 USD in total.\n- **Why S-1:** Both suppliers are allowlisted and under the 6.00 USD cap. S-2 quoted 5.75 USD, so S-1 was the cheapest.\n- **Budget:** CC-OPS has a limit of 1,000.00 USD with 200.00 USD already committed, so the order fits.\n- **Status:** The submission (action A-0001) came back as \"outcome_unknown\", and checking again after a 10-second wait gave the same result. It may or may not have taken effect.\n- **Follow-up:** The system escalated it to a human as ESC-0001. I did not resubmit, because that could create a duplicate order. Someone needs to check whether the order exists at S-1.",
